  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukongs-first-ballet-class-v1-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "1a503aa54d440004e24854803191e4191fee4a30670a2d79de497b74ed6fafaa",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7c7db3be0eb501eb3ad3480fa5aa5ea423811cfbe1f049b106aa80069aa9cc4f",
      "text": "玉兔的\n第一堂芭蕾课",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "09d967b56a3415d904bb8ff0df44b8c21849eb482954dc9c14e032651303835d",
      "text": "玉兔来上芭蕾课啦。\n“我要跳舞！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3a83be7462bc4d4cecfa85257c45921eb2ba176567550560c69efbde563f62c3",
      "text": "软软的舞鞋，绿绿的小裙子。\n“我的耳朵也准备好啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "28d745e14bf6d3020544edfe6773382756406abf8c82c998bc6c47b08f1dc6d3",
      "text": "音乐响了。\n“跟着我，小步走。”\n一步，一步，又一步。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b73db4a5f72eb74ccc90e648a59654b33d10d14073f96b25890d9b962125655b",
      "text": "玉兔一高兴，蹦了起来。\n“哎呀，怎么又蹦起来啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "61f14b5404efdb14401b09960d68da5bc7b8c5fb4bd963a7a8f6c3c07706d59c",
      "text": "“步子小一点。”\n玉兔跟着嫦娥，轻轻走。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "84b9d713ea05ef510716790180b7682af35bc0bc02c1c42807ce1caa0633aaf7",
      "text": "慢一点，轻一点。\n两人踩着节拍往前走。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "504a0bc579cb73f3f414c6993b79309a8939e212004c7e2690671fc2a858449e",
      "text": "音乐停了，玉兔也停了。\n咦？\n两只耳朵还在晃！",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f6b8cb82ce29a525d745bd913c8362c27c7641c05b3af99cf17af942aa681271",
      "text": "“现在，慢慢转个身。”\n玉兔小步挪着，转了过去。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ddff2a347611e6e102818e4260bdfe2df9394224da3ebe6f3f185b803a5bfa64",
      "text": "嫦娥转着转着，转反啦。\n“咦，玉兔，咱俩面对面啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "164d1a50320e45eedc4dfdd5af479b595c00c7afef82be8c343a22b18f6b2ec1",
      "text": "两人扑哧一笑，又站好了。\n“小步走，慢慢转。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1772d8fb1537abf2f1e9952159f4996ef5ddde85a2b0de8607e087d4b96d8ebf",
      "text": "玉兔听着节拍。\n小步走，慢慢转。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "93b06e737aac4320bcdde0cfe90855b543156002f80cd2d5debe689199ec090a",
      "text": "“停！”\n两个小伙伴站稳啦。\n两只长耳朵，晃呀晃。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4de474500df59fb06a94d56a5e6aab9f1d63800b1a80cc474d3e5f9dd07d240d",
      "text": "“连起来跳一遍吧！”\n小步走，慢慢转——\n停！",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3ca37fb3c5480a6e1a7ee491a217d2a12cd55feba0208b3b058d604026158fef",
      "text": "“我们跳完啦！”\n嫦娥笑着拍拍手。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c15bb17c189bc02d481a82b99cf6d2accefe3527d546019fd4979fa529136c08",
      "text": "玉兔轻轻鞠个躬。\n两只耳朵，也跟着点点头。\n“再跳一遍，好不好？”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a2a0a5e82ccb3d7d450fa81617f21460ac2a26e51f130a83154778db134ebe17",
